-| `validate_review_exhausted` | yes | 61 | 20,770 | - |
-| `specify_exact_serialization` | no | 129 | 25,320 | `serialization_and_none_outcomes` |
-| `build_existing_contract` | yes | 83 | 21,264 | - |
