-      </div>
-      <p>Repository A's 717 requirements include 494 created in July by the migration from the earlier workflow, so its requirement count measures the old registers as much as new work. Repository C's source count is the vendored upstream stack; the agent authored a fraction of it, and a third of its requirements are verified by hand because a cross-build or a hardware driver has no unit-test seam.</p>
-
